# UN Plaza (city phase 9): its granite ledges and benches run down both sides of the plaza, and every
# top edge grinds. Rolling east along the north row at 4 m/s just beside the first ledge, an ollie
# and grind pressed in the air: a 50-50 on its south edge.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport 262.3 407.0 0.4 80.3
cmd 2 set skater.vel.x 3.944
cmd 2 set skater.vel.y 0.672
hold ollie 4..14
tap grind 22
run 160
expect event grindStart{trick=BS 50-50,line=ledge_262_408_b} within 29..33
expect no event bail
